 Deletes a Board. Only board administrators can delete a board.
 
+  __Response:__
+
+  Returns `204 No Content` on success.
+
+## Board Publication
+
+Boards can be published so that anyone with a secret public link can see them, no account needed. Only account admins can publish or unpublish a board.
+
+Published boards, their columns, and their published cards can be viewed by anyone at:
+
+- `GET /public/boards/:key`
+- `GET /public/boards/:key/columns/:id`
+- `GET /public/boards/:key/cards/:number`
+
+The `:key` is the board's secret publication key, which is revealed in the board's `public_url` attribute while the board is published (`null` otherwise).
+
+### `POST /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Publishes a board, generating its secret public link. Publishing an already published board keeps its existing link.
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `201 Created` with the board in the same shape as `GET /:account_slug/boards/:board_id`, including its `public_url`:
+
+```json
+{
+  "id": "03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm",
+  "name": "Fizzy",
+  "all_access": false,
+  "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.534Z",
+  "auto_postpone_period_in_days": 30,
+  "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/boards/03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm",
+  "public_url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/public/boards/gX3k9PzR7mQ2vB8nL4cJdW5t",
+  "creator": {
+    "id": "03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7",
+    "name": "David Heinemeier Hansson",
+    "role": "owner",
+    "active": true,
+    "email_address": "david@example.com",
+    "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.401Z",
+    "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/users/03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7"
+  },
+  "user_ids": [
+    "03f5v9zppzlksuj4mxba2nbzn",
+    "03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7"
+  ]
+}
+```
+
+Returns `403 Forbidden` when the requesting user is not an account admin.
+
+### `DELETE /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Unpublishes a board. Its public link stops working immediately.
+
 __Response:__
 
-Returns `204 No Content` on success.
+Returns `204 No Content` on success, or `403 Forbidden` when the requesting user is not an account admin.
 
